## Migration Notes

- CLI code using `construct_u0()` will need to pass a `RootSpace`
- Most existing extractor code can remain unchanged (RustExtractor.extract() still works)
- New code should use `Projection<O, E>` API for explicit composition
- Old TransformStrategy still works via backward compatibility layer (deprecated)

## Implementation Order

1. Create `projection/` module files (root_space, artifact_space, observer, projection)
2. Update `formal/mod.rs` to export new types
3. Modify `transform.rs` to add ProjectionStrategy and ObserverKind
4. Update `model.rs` signatures (execute_transform, construct_u0)
5. Implement Extractor trait in `extract.rs`
6. Update CLI/test code to create RootSpace instances
7. Run verification tests

